<section id="quiz" class="panel global-drop-panel" aria-labelledby="quiz-title">
  <div class="panel-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">SERVER OPERATIONS</span><h2 id="quiz-title">Math quiz</h2></div><button id="quiz-refresh" class="button subtle" type="button">Refresh quiz</button></div>
  <div class="event-body">
    <p class="muted">Exact two-digit-by-one-digit multiplication or division, with four choices. The first question appears at the start, then one every minute. Each player has 10 seconds and one attempt per round.</p>
    <dl class="event-status"><div><dt>Status</dt><dd id="quiz-state">Waiting for a query</dd></div><div><dt>Reward per correct answer</dt><dd id="quiz-item">—</dd></div><div><dt>Cumulative results</dt><dd id="quiz-count">—</dd></div><div><dt>End time</dt><dd id="quiz-end">—</dd></div><div><dt>Next question</dt><dd id="quiz-next">—</dd></div></dl>
    <p id="quiz-asof" class="muted">No automatic refresh.</p>
    <form id="quiz-form">
      <fieldset id="quiz-settings" disabled>
        <legend>Configure a new quiz</legend>
        <div class="event-fields">
          <label>Reward item ID<input id="quiz-item-id" type="number" min="1" max="65535" step="1" required placeholder="E.g. 401" /></label>
          <label>Units per correct answer<input id="quiz-quantity" type="number" min="1" max="60" step="1" value="1" required /></label>
          <label>Duration (minutes)<input id="quiz-minutes" type="number" min="1" max="1440" step="1" value="60" required /></label>
        </div>
        <p class="muted">Each unit uses one inventory slot. If there is not enough space, no reward is delivered and the failure appears in the counter above. There is no ground drop or later claim.</p>
      </fieldset>
      <label for="quiz-reason">Reason for operation</label><input id="quiz-reason" minlength="3" maxlength="200" required placeholder="E.g. community quiz" />
      <div class="event-actions"><button id="quiz-start" class="button primary" type="submit" disabled>Start quiz</button><button id="quiz-stop" class="button subtle" type="button" disabled>End quiz</button><button id="quiz-retry" class="button subtle" type="button" hidden>Check result / retry request</button></div>
    </form>
    <p id="quiz-message" class="form-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    <p class="muted">Requires the updated TMProject client with quiz protocol v1. Characters online when a question is sent can participate; later arrivals wait for the next one. Restarting the server ends the event. The server rejects out-of-round, repeated, or late answers; this does not replace protection against bots using legitimate accounts.</p>
  </div>
</section>
